# Copy to .env.local and fill in. The key is read only on the server, inside
# app/api/chat/route.ts, and is never sent to the browser.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Any model with function calling works; the app adjusts its request
# to suit the family it is pointed at.
#
#   gemini-2.5-flash   default — cheapest, and fast because it is asked not to
#                      think (the copilot answers from a context it is handed)
#   gemini-3.6-flash   better at multi-step tool use; a thinking model, so the
#                      zero thinking budget is dropped automatically
#
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
